{"story":{"id":"story-edff29ae8f2f6829","title":{"zh":"中立舰队","en":"Neutral Fleet"},"category":"society","image":"art/ebf7e5b73371b9262c2f.webp","start":"first_contact_critters.105","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们与这支自称是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]的舰队陷入了僵局。这个不寻常的来客对我们大部分的外交姿态置之不理，但我们可以推断它代表一个独立于星系文明的中立实体。\n\n我们推测，若舰队有传统意义上的所有者，则需要采取非常措施才能接近他们。考虑到这一点，我们总结了目前的发现，供未来的[this.owner.GetScientistPlural]团队使用（如有必要）。","en":"We have reached an impasse with the fleet identifying itself as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. This unusual presence ignored most of our diplomatic overtures, but we can infer that it represents a neutral entity which stands apart from galactic civiliz"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact_critters.105"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.105","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact_critters.105","title":{"zh":"中立舰队","en":"Neutral Fleet"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们与这支自称是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]的舰队陷入了僵局。这个不寻常的来客对我们大部分的外交姿态置之不理，但我们可以推断它代表一个独立于星系文明的中立实体。\n\n我们推测，若舰队有传统意义上的所有者，则需要采取非常措施才能接近他们。考虑到这一点，我们总结了目前的发现，供未来的[this.owner.GetScientistPlural]团队使用（如有必要）。","en":"We have reached an impasse with the fleet identifying itself as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]. This unusual presence ignored most of our diplomatic overtures, but we can infer that it represents a neutral entity which stands apart from galactic civilization.\n\nWe suspect that if the fleet possess any owners in the conventional sense, it would take extraordinary measures to reach them. With this in mind, we have summarized our findings for future teams of [this.owner.GetScientistPlural] to make use of - in case such an opportunity does arise."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/ebf7e5b73371b9262c2f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":